# Cloudflare Pages headers file (STACK.md §12). COOP/COEP are required for
# drift's OPFS-backed SQLite VFS to run at full performance on Web — without
# them, drift silently falls back to a slower IndexedDB VFS (STACK.md §3.2).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# index.html and the service worker must always be revalidated — they're
# what drives the app-update mechanism; caching them long-term would freeze
# users on a stale build (Flutter's own PWA update flow relies on this).
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/flutter_service_worker.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/version.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
